WEBVTT

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:36.890
Caring for pets can be lots of fun.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.320
But when it comes to the 
animals used by ninjas,

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.630
things aren't always simple.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.870
This mission came out of nowhere.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.110
Can you entertain these 
two until I get back?

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:49.040
Sure thing.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.250
They're in good hands.

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:55.810
The Fifth needs me to do something.

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:57.950
Can you watch them for me?

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.220
Certainly, my friend.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:03.180
I, Might Guy, will treat them better
than any boarder you can think of!

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:07.500
I hate to spring this on you, 
but can you take Tonton for me?

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.150
And Katsuyu, just to be on the safe side.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:12.590
It would be my honor!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.190
I'll do my best!

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.620
<b>Caring for Animals is Hard Work</b>

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:31.220
I can't believe we have 
this many at once..

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.040
I hope we can handle it...

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:36.410
Relax.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:37.510
I...

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.630
...can summon my ninja turtle, too!

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.470
Don't add another one!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:44.810
Especially a turtle...

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.770
What's wrong with turtles?!

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:50.640
I've been watching out for you 
brats since you were genins!

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.560
Exactly.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:54.940
For us ninjas, our animals are some 
of our most reliable allies!

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.840
But with me being a shinobi 
who can't use ninjutsu,

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:03.660
I'm not sure I have the skills to care for
ninja hounds and summoned animals.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.140
Don't be absurd!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.620
Just ignite your youthful passion and
you can form a bond with any animal!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.290
Okay...

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.690
Gamakichi and Gamatatsu.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.750
'Sup?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.940
Katsuyu and Tonton.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.930
Kakashi Sensei's eight ninja hounds...

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:23.820
Pakkun.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:24.280
Hi.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.780
Bull, Shiba..

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:26.250
Yo.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:26.770
Biscuit.

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:27.220
Hey.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:27.990
Guruko.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:28.480
Here!

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.000
Uhashi.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:29.460
'Sup.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.020
Akino.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:30.510
Hey.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.050
Uhei.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:31.690
Hey.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.360
There's Kiba and Akamaru.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:38.140
Akamaru, Dynamic Marking!

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.490
Watch where you're spraying!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.760
Wh-What technique...

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.200
No way! It's perfect!

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:53.820
The dogs seem really impressed...

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.420
Is it really that great a move?

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:58.270
I-It looks so fun...

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:01.380
Guy Sensei, don't you 
dare attempt that one!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.590
Hey, what're you guys up to?

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.350
By sheer coincidence,

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:08.300
everyone on our team's 
animal-sitting for someone.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.560
We'll be best friends in no time!

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.110
Bonding though skinship!

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:17.770
This is but another part of youth!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.180
Yes, Guy Sensei!

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:23.490
Yeah, right, he clearly hates it!

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.310
Look, Guy Sensei!

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.910
Akamaru's playing with me!

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.360
Great job, Lee!

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.300
You and Akamaru have clearly 
formed an unbreakable bond!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.670
I seriously doubt it—

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.280
Lee!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.950
Bad dog, Akamaru.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.390
I must say,

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:45.300
you and Akamaru really do 
understand one another, huh, Kiba?

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.210
We've been together since 
we were both babies.

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.520
It's totally different 
from summoned animals.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:53.620
For those who don't know,

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:59.510
summoned animals, like Kakashi Sensei's
dogs, normally live somewhere far away,

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:02.680
and come to the aid of their
summoner only when called upon.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.950
Wait, that means...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.410
We don't need anyone 
to take care of us!

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:08.940
I beg to differ!

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:11.900
We promised to care for 
you with our full power!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:14.620
You're always stubborn about 
things like this, Guy...

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.080
Fine then.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.000
Scatter!

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.250
They ran away!

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.960
If you want to watch us so badly, 
you'll have to catch us first.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:28.710
But the great Pakkun will 
not be caught so easily!

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.680
Don't be such a smug pug!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.930
Yay, we're playing tag, bro!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.640
Run for it!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.100
Stop, Akamaru!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:45.590
Everyone ran away. Even Katsuyu.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.280
Pop quiz, everyone.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:52.500
What shocking action did 
the animals just take?

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:55.080
We already know the answer!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.500
What're we gonna do?!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.460
Obviously...

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:00.320
Give everything to catch 'em all,

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.420
and give them the best care on earth!

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:09.560
All this running is making me hungry.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.140
I want a snack, bro.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.100
What?

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:15.540
You'll have to wait, Gamatatsu.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.580
Yummy!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:27.610
Gamatatsu, that's not 
a snack! It's Tonton!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:32.110
Sorry, I had a craving for pork.

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.450
For the love of...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.660
There you are.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:36.980
Give it up!

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:40.120
Tonton, Katsuyu, we found you!

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.610
Hold it!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.710
Big bro...

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:47.690
Please, just don't hurt 
my brother, all right?

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.580
Don't bother trying to cover for him.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:50.930
Just hear me out.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:55.450
You know what it's like; 
you've got that cousin.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.420
Hinata, I think?

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:02.480
You'd protect Hinata if 
she was in trouble, yeah?

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:05.140
<i>Lady Hinata!</i>

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:08.010
Yeah.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.010
And if Hinata wanted to eat some flies,

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.310
you'd catch some for her, right?

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.100
<i>All that running made me hungry.</i>

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:20.180
<i>Help yourself, Hinata! I caught a bunch!</i>

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.640
That would never happen!

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:24.080
I'm not done.

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:28.570
Don't forget her big, scary dad, 
Hinabunta, remember?

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.520
<i>I'm Hinata, yo!</i>

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:31.910
Hinabunta?!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:32.930
What are you even talking about?!

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.790
Plus Hinahiro and Hinaken...

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.490
<i>Sorry, I'm very clumsy.</i>

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.140
How many types of Hinatas 
do you think there are?!

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:45.070
All kinds, and they live on 
Mount Hinaboku, don't they?

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:46.960
Mount Hinaboku?!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:50.400
I'm sure you can sympathize, so—

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.470
Not in the slightest!

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.150
Tonton?!

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:00.450
But why?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.800
Gamatatsu was one slurp away 
from swallowing you whole...

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.580
...and you'd still protect him?

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:06.540
Oink.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.500
Oink, oink.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:14.970
Oink.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.070
She's obviously saying something cool,

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.720
but I can't understand a word!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.180
Whatever...

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:22.690
We gotcha.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.180
Freeze!

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.820
Wait, stop!

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:33.780
Why do I feel like <i>we're</i> 
being chased, too?

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:38.030
All right, Guy, you asked for it.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.500
Fanged Pursuit Jutsu!

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.310
How you like this, Guy?

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.520
You're stuck now, Guy.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.580
The hunter has become the hunted.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:51.460
Aw, you finally decided to play with me!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.420
He's misinterpreting us...

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:56.050
Guy Sensei!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.280
Look!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:01.600
Kiba and Akamaru are playing with me!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:05.020
Looks like you guys are having fun, too!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.250
Really?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.730
Are you guys really this dumb?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.560
Guy Sensei, do you want to trade two of
your dogs for my Fang Over Fang?

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:15.890
You don't mind?

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.320
What is this?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.040
That tears it.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.810
Akamaru, everyone!

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.500
It's time for our special attack!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.250
A combo attack with all nine dogs?

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.300
Hyper Dynamic Marking!

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.170
Oh, please no!

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:37.450
Gross!

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:39.440
C'mon, Akamaru, combo transformation!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:42.000
The two-headed wolf?!

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.200
When Kiba and Akamaru do 
a combined transformation,

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.600
this is how they end up.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.180
Gotcha!

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:48.310
Wait, no!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:53.070
What happened?!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.170
He got mixed in!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:57.000
Lee, Kiba, and Akamaru 
are doing a combo move!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.490
This is actually pretty cool, huh?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.370
Dude, we couldn't possibly 
look less cool.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.870
Enough, let's run for it!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.330
Wait for us!

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.550
You can't escape!

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:13.210
How's a turtle supposed to catch us?

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:18.270
My ninja turtle is faster than any 
rabbit, or dog for that matter!

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:19.680
What? Wait a sec—

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.250
Collabo Taijutsu, Turtle Power!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:27.450
That turtle's fast!

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.190
Guy Sensei, that was too much!

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:45.150
Is everyone okay?

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:49.790
<i>He...</i>

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:54.300
<i>He managed to get out in 
time to protect the dogs?</i>

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.720
Thanks a million, guys.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.180
We ended up having a lot of fun!

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.630
Looks like it's mission accomplished.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.730
But we've got quite a ways to go.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:10.830
Next time, I'll really 
ignite my youthful fires,

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:13.680
and truly learn to 
understand the animals.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.940
Oh, Lee...

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:22.020
Lee and his pals swear to learn from their
experience and do better next time.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.010
And...

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.580
They got that chance sooner 
than they expected.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.540
Here are our new charges!

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:37.960
Forget it!

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:47.810
It's starting to get chilly out.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.060
Is everyone ready for winter?

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.600
Yeah, maybe we should do some 
joint training once in a while.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.770
Let's go find Hinata.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.100
Wait, isn't that her?

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.650
She seems kinda sad.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.120
No, it's not anything big...

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:13.580
It's just, you know... 
winter's almost here.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.350
What's wrong with winter?

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:17.650
There's lots of fun stuff coming up.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.800
Christmas, New Year's...

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:22.440
The first temple visit, 
Valentine's Day...

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.760
Ah ha, all days best 
enjoyed by couples!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.870
You'd like to spend them 
with Naruto, wouldn't you?

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.930
Is that it, Lady Hinata?!

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:38.670
I'd be happy if I could just get a 
little closer to him, that's all.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.540
But I'll never get the chance...

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.860
Come on, winter hasn't 
even started yet.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.730
We can make all the chances you need.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:50.870
We'll all make sure you spend winter
with a smile on your face!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.810
That includes us!

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:55.460
You guys...

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.000
Neji...

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.810
Fine.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:09.680
<b>Howl at the Naruto!</b>

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:13.640
Planning Meeting

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.640
We've tried going on the offensive
before and it failed miserably.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.720
So this time we'll do the opposite,

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:21.530
and make things feel 
as natural as possible.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:23.740
What specifically are you thinking?

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.170
Something like...

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.330
<i>N-Naruto...</i>

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:36.660
<b>3000 Leagues of Ramen</b>

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.960
Thanks for letting me borrow it first.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:38.440
<i>What're these?</i>

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.420
<i>Just...</i>

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.130
<i>Since you wanted that book I thought 
you'd probably like these, too.</i>

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:45.580
<i>Well then, next time I'll give 
you some of my favorites.</i>

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:50.100
Trading books back and forth 
will start to close the gap,

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.420
and when Christmas rolls around,

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:55.480
she ups the ante with a handmade scarf.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.660
Isn't that a bit too dull?

00:13:56.020 --> 00:14:01.500
Planning Meeting

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.960
No, it's got a nice flow to it.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.480
Whatcha think, Hinata?

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:05.190
I think I can make that feel natural...

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:06.820
Then it's settled.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.440
The game is afoot!

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:13.120
Standing by. What's the situation? Over.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.580
I'm on 4th street.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:18.830
Target is approaching your location. Over.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.730
Excellent.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.000
Get in position, Hinata.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.010
Right!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.300
I wonder if this'll work...

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:31.080
Target is closing in fast... Ah!

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.010
What's wrong?

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:36.430
He's passing the library and 
headed for the shopping mall.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.880
Probably headed to Ichiraku.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.440
Yeah...

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:46.480
How frustrating! We were so close!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.480
Admit it. You were way off.

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:52.060
I mean, Naruto's probably never 
set foot inside a library.

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.340
Good point.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.080
<b>Planning Meeting</b>

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:58.080
My idea was a complete failure.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.290
I guess it just won't happen...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.750
No, that's not true!

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:06.510
We just need to bring Naruto 
here in a casual, natural way.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:09.470
<b>Howl at the Sunset!</b>

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.300
<b>Shino Aburame</b>

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.760
<b>Neji Hyuga</b>

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:13.760
<b>Tenten</b>

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.720
<b>Kiba</b>

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.720
<b>Akamaru</b>

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.680
<b>Rock Lee</b>

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.140
<b>Naruto Uzumaki</b>

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:24.110
Makes sense. We just happen to
run across him out on the town—

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:26.110
Wait, that's your idea of casual?!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:30.160
A police detective would be
able to close in on Naruto,

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.570
and bring him in the most natural way.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:34.780
You're missing the point again...

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.790
<b>Howl at the Sunset!</b>

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.140
Our plan won't work any other way.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.250
Understand, Meatball-Head?

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.320
Meatball-Head... You mean me?!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:47.960
A detective always gives 
his underlings nicknames.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.170
Cool, what's mine?

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:53.640
You're Mittens and he's Boots.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.780
Sweet, dog names!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.630
Those are cat names.

00:15:57.630 --> 00:15:59.450
We don't discriminate in our home.

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:01.100
Fine, just drop it!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:03.070
This is so dumb.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:04.540
And Neji is Big Sis.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.270
What do you mean "Sis?!"

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.150
No insubordination or you're fired.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.240
Let's roll!

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.030
Wait.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.980
You're forgetting something critical.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.770
Um... I am?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.400
My nickname.

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.750
Your nickname is critical?

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.410
Absolutely!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:27.690
If I don't have a nickname,

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.710
it will hinder our ability 
to complete the mission.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.920
Got it, you're Forg O'ten.

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:35.210
Forg... O'ten...

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.050
Forgotten?

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.060
How did this happen...

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.000
Forg!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.370
Please, no!

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:47.360
My poor subordinate! 
I let him get killed in action...

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:51.110
He wasn't KIA. 
You pulled the trigger yourself.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.440
I won't let his sacrifice be in vain!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.320
Let's roll!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.030
U-Um, what should I do?

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.330
Just wait inside.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.540
We'll bring the suspect to you.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.400
Man, I am stuffed!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.630
Guess I'll see what Sakura's up to.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:12.090
You're not getting past me.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.540
What's your problem?

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:16.270
You're a suspect in the 
legendary Amano River murders,

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:18.130
where you used the old "Perfectly timed...

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:21.550
...gluttonous maid finds the melon 
bread dripping with blood" trick!

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:22.800
You're coming with me!

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:24.600
I have no idea what that 
could possibly mean.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:28.060
This'll be a lot easier 
if you come quietly!

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.740
You're not making sense!

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:34.300
The perp's running!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.340
Don't worry.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:38.990
Those two are expert trackers. 
They won't lose him.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:40.450
Exactly.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.060
No one escapes our noses—

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.660
That's...

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.090
You're sure these are good?

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:49.230
Just have a bite.

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:51.890
I know they smell awful, 
but they taste great.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.670
Why are you grilling salted 
horse mackerel out here?!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:56.830
Huh?

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.390
What's wrong, guys?

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:01.720
Mittens, Boots! Respond!

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:05.350
<b>Howl at the Sunset!</b>

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:07.980
Their senses of smell were their downfall.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.400
What happened?

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.010
We lost Mittens and Boots.

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.820
But we'll get him next 
time, I guarantee it.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:16.280
Okay...

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.950
Looks like I lost them.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.510
What on earth was that!

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:23.620
Oh, nice!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.160
Sakura! Where you headed—

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.620
Eight Trigrams Air Palm!

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.790
I don't care if it's a 
trap for the suspect,

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.180
this outfit is too much.

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:36.160
Is Naruto okay?

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:39.440
I may have overdone it a bit...

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.320
Who're you talking to?

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.270
And what is wrong with you people today?!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.700
None of your business.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:47.730
I've got him!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.940
Yeah!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.990
So what, is my crime mistaking...

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:56.590
...the cross-dressing pervert 
Neji for the real Sakura?

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:58.400
Cross-dressing pervert...

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.060
He's a cross-dresser?

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:02.830
<b>Pervert</b>

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:02.830
<b>Pervert</b>

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:01.380
Ew...

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.170
And a pervert?

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:03.210
Keep him away.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.310
No! I would never—

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.710
What the heck?!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.000
<b>Farewell, Detective Big Sis</b>

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.400
I don't wanna die...

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:18.010
<b>Howl at the Sunset!</b>

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.070
Not Big Sis...

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.560
We're out of options. 
We'll have to take him by force.

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.180
You can't!

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:28.890
It won't feel natural at all!

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:30.620
Hinata!

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:33.330
This isn't going down at the library.

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.650
It's going down at the 
scene of the crime!

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.240
Why did you switch to 
Detective Lee Aojima?

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.240
You're supposed to be Chief Leejiro!

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.610
What should I do?

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:44.970
Freeze!

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:46.940
I said freeze, Naruto!

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:49.880
Whatever it is, I didn't do it!

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:06.310
This oughtta shake her.

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:10.890
What?!

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:15.590
End of the line.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:18.180
Now you're Daimon?

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:19.860
Stop changing characters!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.070
That's it. I'm taking you out!

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.530
Not a chance.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.160
Eight Trigrams Defense!

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.030
Thank goodness I got here in time.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.760
Hinata, run!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.640
Are you all right, Hinata?!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:54.350
Naruto, I'm sorry I got in the way...

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.820
Don't talk, we need to 
get you to a hospital!

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:00.280
B-But... I...

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.410
Thanks for saving me.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.870
How did that...

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.380
Hey, all's well that ends well, right?

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:26.340
And so, Hinata managed to get a 
little closer to Naruto, but...

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.300
It'll be about a month before 
you're fully healed.

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:32.520
A whole month?

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:33.970
Don't worry.

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:36.980
Rest up and we'll have you out 
of here just before New Year's!

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:44.620
Unfortunately, she'll have to spend 
Christmas in a hospital bed.

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:23.830
Next week is "Tenten vs. Temari!"

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:26.210
<b>Tenten vs. Temari!
Orochimaru's Search for Love!</b>

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:26.210
and "Orochimaru's Search for Love!"

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:27.550
Is that so?

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:28.980
You're not curious?

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:31.300
Look, even Orochimaru 
wants to get married!

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:33.410
You and the other senseis should 
think about settling down, too!

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:38.020
I-I'm more interested in reading the final
book in the Make-Out Tactics series.

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:40.390
Y-Yeah, I'm too busy with my training,

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:41.770
I've got no time to date.

00:23:41.770 --> 00:23:45.610
I hear those are common excuses
for men who are too old to find a wife.
